BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (Step: 3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (Title: Build the record set) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Action: Add the A or CNAME records for the root \(@\) and www, set TTL to Auto, keep web records) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (orange-clouded, and set MX and TXT records to gray.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (Detail: Fill in Type, Name, Content, TTL, and proxy status for each record, then save. Allow a few minutes) Tj ET
