BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (Action: At BigRock, go to Manage, click Revert to Old Look, then Manage Orders, Fast Transfer, and Opt In,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (and confirm with the emailed verification code.) Tj ET
