BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (the domain listing for fast transfer [PG Tech Help - 0QCYIFcFO7A @ 00:00:33].) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 495.85 Tm (The Cloudflare onboarding sequence is the same in every walkthrough. Easytorial's version: log in, click Add) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 480.62 Tm (a Site or Onboard a Domain, enter the real domain, and pick a plan, which for most people is the free one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 465.40 Tm (Cloudflare then scans for existing A, CNAME, and MX records so nothing gets lost in a migration. Review) Tj ET
